"entity": {
"name": "Aperam S.A.",
"description": "Aperam SA engages in the production of steel and value added products. It operates through the following segments: Stainless and Electrical Steel, Services and Solutions, Alloys and Specialties, and Recycling. The Stainless and Electrical Steel segment produces grain and non-grain oriented steel products. The Services and Solutions segment includes the tubes business. The Alloys and Specialties segment is involved in the design, manufacture, and transformation of specialty alloys and certain specific stainless steels. The Recycling segment recycles stainless steel scrap and superalloys. The company was founded on September 9, 2010 and is headquartered in Luxembourg.",
